{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">TVB「御用秘書」之稱的葉凱茵，入行逾20年參演過無數經典劇集。早前她驚喜現身參賽《中年好聲音4》，雖然最終遺憾落選，但她在舞台上淚崩的真情剖白，以及背後與丈夫互相扶持的感人故事，深深觸動了無數觀眾的心。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ip_hoi_yan_fan_1717604447_3383833824029584690_52499445.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026Dx7XnmBzIj1786336499.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ip_hoi_yan_fan_1717604447_3383833824029584690_52499445.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">近日，葉凱茵在社交平台上報平安，分享了最新近況並宣布正式復工！相片中的她雖然精神飽滿、笑容燦爛，但身形明顯消瘦了一整圈，惹來不少網民關心。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">她發文透露自己早前身體抱恙：「今日返公司開工，開心、感恩！💜 見到同事們，佢哋話我瘦咗，其實我係因禍得福😅 之前因為身體唔係幾舒服，所以清減咗啲🙏。」經歷過高低起伏，她坦言現時人到中年，更懂得珍惜身體：「飲食比以前注重咗，日常規律都比以前乖啲，健康比一切重要💪🏻大家都要身體健康喔！」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ip_hoi_yan_fan_1785916911_3956876305547167552_52499445.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026leOoVF7U3g1786336499.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ip_hoi_yan_fan_1785916911_3956876305547167552_52499445.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ip_hoi_yan_fan_1785916911_3956876304632993219_52499445.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026UYAjh0lBiP1786336499.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ip_hoi_yan_fan_1785916911_3956876304632993219_52499445.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ip_hoi_yan_fan_1772096626_3840946758407625661_52499445.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026spQCHrBL8r1786336499.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ip_hoi_yan_fan_1772096626_3840946758407625661_52499445.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"12_1200.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026olESg1ugGc1786336500.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"12_1200.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">葉凱茵於2009年與從事眼鏡生意的圈外商人結婚，兩年後誕下愛子Orson，一家三口本應幸福美滿。後來她成功懷上第二胎，但在臨盆前三星期、懷孕滿9個月之際，卻不幸患上突發性妊娠毒血症。當時情況極度危急，她險些中風，最終更遺憾地痛失腹中胎兒，身心遭受巨大打擊。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">回憶起當時的險境，葉凱茵曾透露搶救時輸了足足三包血，產後血壓持續高企導致嚴重頭暈，肝腎功能更一度下降，甚至出現視力模糊、眨眼見到閃光的恐怖症狀。直到休養了整整三個月，身體才慢慢復元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">面對突如其來的喪子之痛與健康重創，幸好有丈夫的不離不棄和寶貝兒子的陪伴，成為她最強大的精神支柱。靠著家人的愛，葉凱茵一步一腳印地重新振作起來。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T08:20:01.736462+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":608,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}